title: "drone-agriculture-forecast: bibliometric data and MATLAB growth-model pipeline for UAV research in agriculture"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-01"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vedranu/drone-agriculture-forecast"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22172737
