keywords:
  - unmanned aerial vehicles
  - precision agriculture
  - agricultural drones
  - bibliometrics
  - technology forecasting
  - growth models
  - MATLAB
abstract: >-
  Annual OpenAlex counts (2005-2025) of articles combining UAV terms with agricultural
  terms, using a documented noise-filtered query, with normalising denominators and seven
  sub-domains, and a toolbox-free MATLAB pipeline fitting exponential, logistic, Gompertz
  and Bass growth models by Poisson deviance, comparing them with QAICc, backtesting them
  and producing negative-binomial bootstrap forecast intervals for 2028-2035. Companion
  to the drone-ecology-forecast repository (doi:10.5281/zenodo.22119199).
